# 🔄 Data Flow

## Registration Flow

```text
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ REGISTRATION FLOW                                                    │
│                                                                      │
│ User → Register → Create Profile Dir → Save to MongoDB              │
│ ↓                                                                    │
│ Chrome Detection (background)                                        │
│                                                                      │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

## Login + Launch Flow

```text
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ LOGIN + LAUNCH FLOW                                                  │
│                                                                      │
│ User → Login → Check MinIO ──→ Found? ──Yes→ Download & Restore      │
│                           │                    │                     │
│                           │ No→ Create Fresh   │                     │
│                           ↓                    ↓                     │
│ Launch Chrome ←── Profile Ready                                     │
│                                                                      │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

## Browser Close Flow

```text
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ BROWSER CLOSE FLOW                                                   │
│                                                                      │
│ Close Browser → 2s Debounce → Compress (ZIP Level 9)                 │
│ ↓                                                                    │
│ Split into 50MB Chunks                                               │
│ ↓                                                                    │
│ Encrypt (AES-256-GCM per chunk)                                      │
│ ↓                                                                    │
│ Upload to MinIO (Randomized Path)                                    │
│ ↓                                                                    │
│ Save Metadata to MongoDB                                             │
│ ↓                                                                    │
│ Delete Old MinIO Chunks                                              │
│ ↓                                                                    │
│ Delete Local Profile Folder                                          │
│                                                                      │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

## Deletion Flow

```text
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ DELETION FLOW                                                        │
│                                                                      │
│ User → Verify (Key+Pass+PIN) → Get OTP → Confirm OTP                │
│ ↓                                                                    │
│ Deletion Request (PENDING)                                           │
│ ↓                                                                    │
│ Admin Approval (APPROVED)                                            │
│ ↓                                                                    │
│ 24h Grace Period                                                     │
│ ↓                                                                    │
│ Auto-Processor (Every 1 Hour)                                        │
│ ├── Delete MinIO Chunks                                              │
│ ├── Delete Chest Items                                               │
│ ├── Delete Local Files                                               │
│ └── Delete User from DB                                              │
│                                                                      │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

