# 💻 Technology Stack

## Backend

| Technology | Version | Purpose |
|------------|---------|---------|
| **Node.js** | 18+ | Runtime Environment |
| **Express.js** | 4.18+ | API Framework |
| **MongoDB Atlas** | 7.x | Primary Database |
| **Mongoose** | 7.x | ODM for MongoDB |
| **MinIO** | Latest | Object Storage (S3 Compatible) |
| **Playwright** | 1.40+ | Browser Automation |
| **Archiver** | 6.x | ZIP Compression |
| **AdmZip** | 0.5.x | ZIP Extraction |
| **Bcrypt** | 5.x | Password Hashing |

## Frontend

| Technology | Version | Purpose |
|------------|---------|---------|
| **React** | 18.x | UI Framework |
| **Axios** | 1.x | HTTP Client |
| **CSS3** | - | Styling with Animations |

## Security

| Technology | Purpose |
|------------|---------|
| **AES-256-CBC** | Text/Data Encryption |
| **AES-256-GCM** | Chunk Encryption (Authenticated) |
| **SHA-256** | Integrity Verification |
| **Scrypt** | Key Derivation |
| **HMAC** | Message Authentication |

