# ✨ Features

## 🔐 Core Features

- ✅ **Auto-Generated Unique Keys**: 8-character cryptographically secure keys
- ✅ **User-Defined Passwords & PINs**: Users set their own credentials
- ✅ **OTP Verification**: For sensitive operations (deletion)
- ✅ **Chrome Profile Detection**: Auto-detects installed Chrome & profiles
- ✅ **Profile Sync**: Compress → Encrypt → Upload → Restore cycle
- ✅ **Secure Chest**: Encrypted personal vault for files & notes
- ✅ **Profile Photos**: Encrypted photo storage
- ✅ **Account Deletion**: Graceful 24-hour deletion with admin approval

## 🔒 Security Features

- ✅ **AES-256-CBC Encryption**: For passwords, PINs, phone numbers, keys
- ✅ **AES-256-GCM Encryption**: For profile chunks (authenticated encryption)
- ✅ **SHA-256 Checksums**: Integrity verification at every step
- ✅ **Randomized MinIO Paths**: User identity hidden in storage
- ✅ **Key Derivation**: Unique encryption key per user (scrypt)
- ✅ **Constant-Time Comparison**: Prevents timing attacks
- ✅ **Encrypted Database**: All sensitive fields encrypted at rest

## ☁️ Cloud Features

- ✅ **MinIO Object Storage**: S3-compatible distributed storage
- ✅ **Chunked Uploads**: 50MB chunks for efficient transfer
- ✅ **Parallel Downloads**: 3 concurrent chunk downloads
- ✅ **Auto Cleanup**: Old chunks deleted on new upload
- ✅ **Metadata Tracking**: Full upload history in MongoDB

## 🎨 UI/UX Features

- ✅ **Premium Light Theme**: Professional color palette
- ✅ **Animated Backgrounds**: Floating orbs & grid patterns
- ✅ **Glassmorphism Cards**: Modern frosted glass design
- ✅ **Drag & Drop Chest**: Intuitive file management
- ✅ **Password Strength Meter**: Real-time feedback
- ✅ **Step Indicators**: Visual progress for multi-step flows
- ✅ **Responsive Design**: Works on all screen sizes

