# 🔌 API Endpoints

## Authentication

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth |
|----------|----------|-------------|------|
| `POST` | `/api/generate-key` | Generate unique 8-char key | No |
| `POST` | `/api/register` | Register new user | No |
| `POST` | `/api/login` | Login user | No |
| `POST` | `/api/upload-photo` | Upload profile photo | No |

## Browser Management

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth |
|----------|----------|-------------|------|
| `POST` | `/api/launch-browser` | Launch Chrome with profile | No |
| `POST` | `/api/close-browser` | Close browser (triggers upload) | No |

## Chest (Encrypted Vault)

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth |
|----------|----------|-------------|------|
| `POST` | `/api/chest/add` | Add item to chest | No |
| `GET` | `/api/chest/list/:uniqueKey` | List all chest items | No |
| `GET` | `/api/chest/item/:itemId` | Get & decompress item | No |
| `DELETE` | `/api/chest/item/:itemId` | Delete chest item | No |

## Account Deletion

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth |
|----------|----------|-------------|------|
| `POST` | `/api/delete/verify` | Verify identity & send OTP | No |
| `POST` | `/api/delete/confirm` | Confirm deletion with OTP | No |

## User Info

| Method | Endpoint | Description | Auth |
|----------|----------|-------------|------|
| `GET` | `/api/user/:uniqueKey` | Get user details | No |
| `GET` | `/api/health` | Server health check | No |

