# 📊 Usage Statistics

| Metric | Value |
|----------|----------|
| Compression Ratio | ~60% (72MB → 31MB) |
| Upload Time | 3-7 seconds (local MinIO) |
| Restore Time | 2-5 seconds |
| Max Chunk Size | 50 MB |
| Encryption | AES-256-GCM |
| Key Derivation | scrypt (unique per user) |
| Supported Platforms | Windows, macOS, Linux |
| Chrome Versions | All versions supported |

