# 🌍 Societal Impact

## 🏢 For Enterprises

- Centralized Profile Management: IT admins can manage employee browser profiles
- Compliance: Encrypted storage meets GDPR, HIPAA requirements
- Disaster Recovery: Profiles backed up to cloud, instantly restorable
- Audit Trail: Complete deletion request tracking

## 🎓 For Education

- Lab Environments: Students get consistent browser setups
- Research: Reproducible browser environments for web research
- Privacy: Student data encrypted and protected

## 🏠 For Individuals

- Data Portability: Take your browser anywhere
- Privacy Protection: Military-grade encryption
- No Vendor Lock-in: Self-hosted, you own your data
- Free & Open Source: No subscription fees

## 🔬 For Testing & QA

- Isolated Profiles: Separate profiles for different test scenarios
- Snapshot Restore: Rollback to any saved state
- Parallel Testing: Multiple profiles running simultaneously

